OL,3,GNEWSALockhart 'dumbfounded' at lack of
OL,4,AParades Commission resignations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Democratic Unionist Party (DUP) MP
OL,7,Fhas said she is "dumbfounded" that
OL,8,FParades Commission members have not
OL,9,F"already voluntarily resigned"
OL,10,Ffollowing a court ruling over one of
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland's most contentious
OL,12,Fparades.
OL,14,FThe High Court quashed a decision to
OL,15,Fimpose restrictions on the annual
OL,16,Fparade at Drumcree outside Portadown on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,19,FThe commission had banned this year's
OL,20,Fparade from the mainly nationalist
OL,21,FGarvaghy Road - a move which reflected
OL,22,Fevery decision it has made since 1998.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
