OL,3,GNEWSALockhart 'dumbfounded' at lack of
OL,4,AParades Commission resignations
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarla Lockhart, DUP, said there would
OL,7,Fbe a fresh application to parade. Sinn
OL,8,FFein's John O'Dowd said it was
OL,9,F"completely beyond me" as to why the
OL,10,FDUP and Orange Order and others were
OL,11,F"refighting this battle".
